@worker_cells
title: Organizing the NSBO
subtitle: Win over the industrial urban working class.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] 
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; working_class_nsdap += 6 * (1 - internal_party_dissent);

We have ramped up our anti-capitalist rhetoric and factory leafleting to win over blue-collar laborers.

@faction_unity
title: Factional mediation
subtitle: De-escalate friction between the Northern and Southern party offices.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; internal_party_dissent -= 10;

Strasser has used his organizational leverage to temporarily smooth over tensions with Hitler's Munich faction.

@crisis_socialism
title: Push for the "Socialist" Program
subtitle: Strasser can pivot the party toward aggressive state-socialism.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer <= 0 and nationalization_adopted == 0 and black_thursday_seen == 1 and left_wing_nsdap_support <= 3
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?][? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : The capitalist economy has not yet collapsed. ?][? if radical_nationalization_adopted > 0 : We have already adopted the Strasser Program. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6; 
go-to: crisis_program.support_strasser_left

@strasser_economic_plan
title: Support the moderate national plan
subtitle: Strasser can also pitch a pragmatic economic program to work with Schleicher.
choose-if: advisor_action_timer = 0 and corporate_compromise_adopted = 0 and black_thursday_seen = 1
unavailable-subtitle: [? if advisor_action_timer > 0 : [+ advisor_action_timer +] months before next advisor action. ?] [? if strasser_economic_plan == 0 : We have already committed to our economic framework. ?] [? if black_thursday_seen == 0 : The capitalist economy has not yet collapsed. ?]
on-arrival: advisor_action_timer = 6
go-to: crisis_program.support_strasser_moderate

